.TH LESS 1 "2026" "KERNEL32" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
less \- pagineur / file pager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B less
[-NSi] [+/pattern] [file...]
.br
.SH DESCRIPTION
Displays files (or standard input) one screen at a time. Keys: space f ^F next page, b ^B previous page, d u half page, j k Enter arrows by line, g G Ng top,
bottom, line N, p N% percentage, / ? n N search (regular expressions, matches highlighted), -N toggle line numbers, -S toggle chopping of long lines, =
position, v edit with vi, :n :p next and previous file, h help, q quit.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -N
Show line numbers.
.TP
.B -S
Chop long lines instead of wrapping them.
.TP
.B -i
Ignore case in searches.
.TP
.B +/pattern
Start at the first line matching pattern.
.SH SEE ALSO
more(1), vi(1), man(1)
